# Ollama Chat Endpoint Documentation

## Request Format

The chat endpoint is `POST /api/chat`. Basic request structure:

```json
{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello!"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Key Parameters:**
- `model` (required): Model name following `model:tag` format
- `messages` (required): Array of message objects with `role` and `content`
- `stream`: Boolean to control streaming (default: true)
- `format`: JSON schema or "json" for structured/JSON mode output
- `tools`: Array of tool definitions for tool calling
- `options`: Model parameters (temperature, etc.)
- `keep_alive`: How long model stays loaded (default: 5m)

## Streaming Response Format

When streaming is enabled, responses arrive as newline-delimited JSON objects:

```json
{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "created_at": "2023-08-04T08:52:19.385406455-07:00",
  "message": {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "Response text"
  },
  "done": false
}
```

Final streamed object includes statistics:
```json
{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "created_at": "2023-08-04T19:22:45.499127Z",
  "message": {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": ""
  },
  "done": true,
  "total_duration": 10706818083,
  "load_duration": 6338219291,
  "prompt_eval_count": 26,
  "prompt_eval_duration": 130079000,
  "eval_count": 259,
  "eval_duration": 4232710000
}
```

## Tool Calling Format

Request with tools:
```json
{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "messages": [...],
  "tools": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "tool_name",
        "description": "What it does",
        "parameters": {...}
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Response with tool invocation:
```json
{
  "message": {
    "role": "assistant",
    "tool_calls": [
      {
        "function": {
          "name": "function_name",
          "arguments": {...}
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

## Non-Streaming Response

Set `"stream": false` for complete response in single object:

```json
{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "created_at": "2023-08-04T19:22:45.499127Z",
  "message": {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "Complete response text"
  },
  "done": true,
  "total_duration": 5043500667,
  "load_duration": 5025959,
  "prompt_eval_count": 26,
  "prompt_eval_duration": 325953000,
  "eval_count": 290,
  "eval_duration": 4709213000
}
```

All durations are in nanoseconds.

